WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.520
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:11.400
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.660
My name is Nijino Yume.

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:18.580
I'm a second-year exchange student at the idol middle school, Venus Ark.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.080
I work my hardest at Aikatsu every day!

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:26.540
Right now, I'm studying up on Star Premium Rare Coords.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:34.090
When your Premium Rare Dress is approved by the Aikatsu System, it's bequeathed with Star Wings!

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:36.720
I definitely want to get my own!

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:49.940
Still only three.

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:52.780
Enter.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:58.070
Elza, what did you need from me?

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:01.200
Rei, I have a question for you.

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:04.370
You've been aboard for quite some time.

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:07.750
How long do you intend to continue simply supporting me?

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.340
I believe I told you before.

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:13.380
I am here only for you.

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:14.550
Is that the truth?

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:19.470
In my eyes, you appear to be running away from something.

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:25.350
If you sincerely wish for my best, follow your destiny.

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:26.850
In other words...

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:32.280
I understand, Elza.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.220
Hey everyone!

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.720
It's almost Tanabata!

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.470
It's so shiny!

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:28.520
Impressive, huh?

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:30.980
But what's Tanabata?

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:36.900
You see, it's the one day of the year when the two lovers Orihime and Hikoboshi,

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:39.650
separated by the Milky Way, are allowed to meet.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:48.120
And if you write a wish to the stars on these papers, it'll come true!

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:51.160
Kirara loves stuff like that!

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:53.670
Attention, girls!

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.380
The wish papers are over here.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.500
We've got a variety of pens too!

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:58.920
Over here!

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.560
I'm glad that got them all excited.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:11.640
This scene brings back memories.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:13.980
Do you remember what happened last year?

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.560
I'd never forget.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.820
We all wrote our wishes together.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:24.320
Yume, Mahiru, what are you wishing for this year?

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:25.990
Good question.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:27.330
I chose this.

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:30.620
To make Spice Chord the best brand in the world.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.580
Oh, that's great!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:36.460
I put that I wish to design a Premium Rare Dress!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.710
Yeah, yeah! I love it!

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.590
My objective is to "Take down Mahiru". {changed from "Defeat Onee-chan"}{does there a reason we're not using "defeat mahiru"?}{felt like it}

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:44.430
You want to beat yourself?

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:47.180
I want to <i>surpass</i> myself.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:51.220
Growing more every day to become a newer me.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:53.140
Mahiru-chan, that's awesome!

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:55.100
I know you'll make it real.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:58.520
Way to go! As for me...

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:01.780
Look! I'll be the world's brightest star! {ep 59}

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:04.570
The world's brightest star... that's great!

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.070
You'll have to work hard on the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:07.990
Yep!

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.740
Excuse me!

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:13.160
Can I get a little help here?!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.580
Oh, I forgot!

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:15.870
Sorry!

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:21.920
So very intriguing.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:25.090
Japan has such a diversity of traditions.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.930
How droll.

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:29.430
Ah, Elza-sama!

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:32.930
Elza-sama, you're gonna write a wish too, right?

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.390
That's not my style.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:36.770
Aw, come on!

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.730
Write one!

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:43.610
Ah! Caro-tan, you caaan't eat that! {we can reformat this to include baa or baad. also I guess Kirara's turning into Otome}{this is fine maybe}

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.570
Hey, come back!

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:47.740
Wait!

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:51.030
Rei, the preparations are complete.

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:53.450
Have you sorted out your feelings?

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.200
Of course.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.210
I have high expectations.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.830
Your expectations...

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.130
I can't afford to betray them.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.680
Shooting Star is coming out of hiatus?

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.090
You mean that model?

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.010
Yeah! I can't wait!

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.050
Me too.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.100
Mahiru-chan, work it!

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:22.230
Okay! That's the stuff!

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.780
Drop everything! Big news!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:26.900
Chief Editor?

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:30.660
You all know that Shooting Star is coming out of hiatus, right?

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:37.910
Shooting Star? You mean the model who disappeared from the scene in a flash like her namesake?

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:38.790
Exactly.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:41.250
Get this—I managed to book her!

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:42.040
What?!

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:46.420
I'd like to throw her into a shoot right away. What do you think?

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.130
Shooting Star is coming here?

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:48.510
Mahiru-chan?

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.010
Seriously?

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.300
I'd be honored!

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.010
I was hoping you'd say that.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:54.510
Please, come in.

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.650
I'm Kizaki Rei. I look forward to working with you.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:06.230
Rei-san... I thought so.

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:08.110
So you had realized.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:10.360
It was just a feeling.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:13.620
The advice you gave me was perfect.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:18.790
Such professional advice had to have come from someone within the modeling industry.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:22.960
Okay, let's get those shutters going!

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:31.090
You two are amazing! Just the best!

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:33.470
<i>Is she really coming off a break? {break}</i>

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:37.890
<i>Her poses and expression crafting are perfect.</i>

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:41.890
Thank you, everyone.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.770
Mahiru, where are you off to next?

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:47.780
Oh, I'm recording for my show.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.150
That program...

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:53.240
I saw that back when Yozora hosted it.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:54.740
You saw my sister on it?

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:55.910
Yeah.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:08:00.330
I've collaborated with Yozora on a few shows in New York.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.080
So you know each other.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.920
Yeah. She was so lustrous...

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.960
As though she were the moon...

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:09.130
Yes, she was like the moon.

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.260
She's a star in my eyes.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:13.130
A star?

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:16.260
The blindingly bright first star!

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:17.600
I see.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:18.430
Actually...

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:22.640
If you'd like, would you want to make a guest appearance on the show?

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:23.890
Right now?{...}{,,,}

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.810
Yes, please.

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.320
All right. I'll take you up on the offer.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.280
It's Mahiru's Fashion Time.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:38.030
Next up is our quick-tips advice corner.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:42.040
The theme of the day is how to be stylish in a yukata.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:46.210
Let's see, for this thick yukata with vertical stripes...

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:47.670
What's it gonna be?

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:51.090
Use a brightly colored obi, and add some fun patterns too.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:54.760
Keep playing around with different designs until you find a style you like.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:09:00.810
And if you wear a straw hat and carry around a handbag that matches, you'll stand out even more.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:05.310
My, that gives it a completely 
different air! How fashionable!

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:09.400
Rei-san, your taste and knowledge are both perfect!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.480
Thanks.

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:15.610
So Rei-san was a model.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:19.160
That gets me going.

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:20.910
Did you know this, Koharu-chan?

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:21.910
Nope.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:27.540
By the time I came here, Rei-san was already focusing on supporting Elza-sama.

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.040
I see.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:32.130
Then she must've been practicing in secret.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:35.220
There's no way she could've been so perfect otherwise.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:43.770
Rei-chan!

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:46.390
Geez, you baad girl!

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:48.560
Why'd you keep it a secret?

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:50.940
I just had no opportunity to tell you.

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.980
Oh, pull the other one!

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.450
But now Kirara's excited!

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:57.700
For what?

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:01.580
For the day we get to take the stage together!

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:07.460
I'll have to polish my performance to perfection before then.

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:10.210
Goodbye, everyone!

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.840
Goodbye!

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:15.590
See you!

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:19.760
That concludes today's show. Thank you for coming.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:16.170
Thanks!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:16.840
Bye-bye!

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:23.260
Thank you.

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:25.100
We'll be back again.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.730
Well done today.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.480
Thank you.

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:29.940
See you next time.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.270
Yes.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:34.980
Rei-san, I was entranced by your stage walking!

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:37.610
How did you ever get to that level?

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:42.700
It was nothing special. All it takes is regular practice to improve your skills.

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:43.990
Precisely.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.410
Elza-san.

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:48.580
Elza...

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.170
You were watching.

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:51.710
Rei.

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:54.880
Your skills are truly worthy of being called perfect.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:56.630
However...

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:00.840
There is something you are overwhelmingly in want of.

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:10.270
Do not disappoint me any further.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:34.080
Sorry you had to see that. {I actually thought up this after submitting}

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:35.000
No...

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:39.470
Um, why would Elza-san say something like that?

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:43.140
Do you remember the story about the model I told you before?

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.260
The model?

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:52.020
You mean the extremely talented model who decided to go with Elza-san after hearing her criticism?

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.610
There's a continuation to that story.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:02.490
The model followed Elza onto her ship.

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:06.700
She then began training to find direction and passion.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:12.080
Unfortunately, no matter how much she worked, she could grasp neither.

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:16.960
And one day, something happened that changed her fate.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:24.220
Elza shined greater than anyone else had before.

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:28.220
The model was enchanted by Elza's radiant light. {same phrase Mahiru uses later}

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:29.970
It captivated her.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:36.110
Since then, she decided to find happiness in helping Elza shine.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:41.030
In time, she lost the will to polish her own glimmer.

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.490
Does that mean...

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.400
Yes.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:45.530
It was me.

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.660
Rei-san...

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:50.490
That's such a waste!

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:55.920
There's no reason to sacrifice yourself for someone else's shine.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:13:01.050
Faced with the stunning light of a bright star, what you should do is shine even brighter!

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.930
That's an intriguing view.

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:08.470
But no one can shine alongside a star so bright.

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:13.390
Under the glow of the brightest star, any other would simply look dull.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:16.100
You can't know that until you try!

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.480
Mahiru-chan...

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.610
Thank you.

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:21.820
But I already know.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:24.900
Didn't you see Elza perform too?

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:28.740
Yeah, Elza-san's performance was stunning.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:31.910
But I never once thought about giving up.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.710
When we see a brilliant star,

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.460
we work together to shine even brighter.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:42.760
And when we look back, we find that we're brighter than ever before.

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:45.470
I see.

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:48.680
So that's how Four Star does things.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:52.640
Please come and watch my show.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:56.020
I'm sure you'll understand then.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.190
Got it.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.400
Mahiru-chan!

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.350
Mahiru-chan!

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:35.640
Do you mind if we join your practice?

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:39.650
Seeing you work hard lit a fire under us.

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:41.940
Sure, I'd love that!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:58.000
Thank you for waiting! We now begin 
Romance Kiss's Premium Dress fashion show!

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.460
It's finally time.

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:06.460
We'll be counting on Mahiru to show what S4 can really do.

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:08.380
Mahiru will do great.

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:20.980
So cute!

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:24.860
Romance Kiss's whole feeling has changed from when Yozora-senpai was in charge.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:27.990
Mahiru's Romance Kiss gets me going!

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:29.740
You've got that right.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.750
Hey. It's been a while.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.750
Bonjour, Rei.

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:48.880
Yozora... I guess the first star has made her appearance.

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:55.510
My, is that how Mahiru really thinks of me?

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:57.760
I couldn't be happier.

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:03.020
Basically, Mahiru views you as I view Elza.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:07.360
You and Elza are our infallible guiding stars.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:10.780
I think that's a bit off.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:14.490
Mahiru and I are also rivals.

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:18.200
But Elza-chan has no rivals, does she?

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.540
Of course not.

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:24.880
Really? Then Elza-chan might just be a bit lonely.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:26.710
Lonely?

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:28.050
Elza?

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:32.930
Mahiru was still a new model when she enrolled.

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:37.800
At the time, I may have been her first star.

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:43.230
But from there, she scraped her way up in an effort to surpass me.

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:47.520
And ultimately, she managed to do it at the S4 Selection.

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:51.900
Mahiru surpassed you?

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:56.410
Yes. I was overjoyed to see her growth.

00:16:56.410 --> 00:17:04.290
It was because she was there, always chasing after my back, that I was able to do my best.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:08.790
Nothing compares to having a rival.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:14.050
Now presenting the muse of 
Romance Kiss, Kasumi Mahiru!

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:17.800
Look.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:21.220
Right now, Mahiru is my own first star!

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:30.190
Romance Kiss's Premium Rare Dress is the Daylight Festival Coord.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:31.780
Kasumi Mahiru...

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:35.570
Like a radiant light!

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:55.190
Yozora... do you think I can shine too?

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:58.320
It's all up to your feelings.

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:02.400
For Elza... I, too...

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:13.910
The Neptune Star Premium Rare Coord.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:17.790
Mahiru-chan!

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:20.000
Yume... girls!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.630
You did it, Mahiru!

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:23.260
Excellently done.

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:27.550
It's amazing! Seriously... congratulations.

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.800
Yeah, thanks!

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:34.310
Mahiru-chan, your dress was fabulous. You were absolutely radiant in it.

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:38.900
Hearing that from a design student makes me super happy!

00:21:39.810 --> 00:21:41.400
Mahiru!

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:43.190
O-Onee-chan?!

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:46.070
Yozora-senpai?!

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:48.110
My, if it isn't Koharu-chan!

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:49.410
Have you been well?

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:51.870
Yes, I'm doing fine.

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:53.790
Onee-chan, why are you here?

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:56.920
How could I miss such an important show?

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:59.420
I took a quick trip home.

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:04.010
A quick trip? Aren't you supposed to be studying in France?

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:06.050
Don't be so stiff.

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:09.140
Isn't it fine? Tonight is Tanabata.

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:13.350
Geez, Tanabata has nothing to do with this.

00:22:13.350 --> 00:22:14.560
You think so?

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:16.310
Yes, I do!

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:19.020
It's like we're Orihime and Hikoboshi!

00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:20.400
What are you saying?!

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:59.750
